        "id": 1541085
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-11-17T20:59:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is what we did for the [npcx](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/chip/npcx/otp_key.c;l\u003d106?q\u003dplatform%2Fec%20otp_key_provision\u0026ss\u003dchromiumos%2Fchromiumos%2Fcodesearch#:~:text\u003d105-,106,-107) project. If the key is trivial, what do we need to do? We cannot continue the boot up process. The security is broken??",
      "parentUuid": "8ab046bb_3f00d5c2",
      "revId": "129b551019ab4afc1ca9e394186b4db812fc5286",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
